This task shows how machine learning can be used to analysie commodity market data and predict prices. By comparing various models, we were able to identify the best performing one which was Random Forest, based on lowest RMSE. This can be used for various other problems in agribusiness such as predicting crop yields, demand and resources as long as the right data is used and features are available.

